#org @gText_mistyexplode_3
Can you imagine?\nIf this volcano were to erupt?\pThe explosion would be the end of\nus. How terrifying is that?\pWhile we're terrified, would you\nlike to learn [GREEN]Misty Explosion?[BLUE]

#org @gText_mistyexplode_4
You're terribly brave!\pGo, have at it!

#org @gText_mistyexplode_5
Using [GREEN]Misty Explosion[BLUE] while on this\nvolcano[.]\pWhat a terrifying thrill!

#org @gText_mistyexplode_6
Yeah, you're right.\nIt is too terrifying.

#org @gText_mtember_grunt1_1
Call us an active volcano,\n'cause Team Magma is about to erupt!

#org @gText_mtember_grunt1_2
Well[.] Only thing that's erupting from\nme is my sweat[.]

#org @gText_mtember_grunt1_3
They say there're over 1,500\nactive volcanoes in the world.\pJust thinking about them makes me\nfeel all hot and gooey inside!

#org @gText_mtember_grunt2_1
I've been in Team Magma so I can mend\nmy broken heart[.]\p[.]ya calling me a simp?\nCome here, kid!

#org @gText_mtember_grunt2_2
J-just leave me alone[.]

#org @gText_mtember_grunt2_3
The way you battle, it reminds me\nof the girl who dumped me[.]\pI felt so lost afterwards, and joined\nTeam Magma. The brotherhood\lmakes me feel less lonely.

#org @gText_mtember_grunt3_1
Do you know how caves form inside\nvolcanoes?

#org @gText_mtember_grunt3_2
Tsk. You wanna know more\nabout volcanoes or what?

#org @gText_mtember_grunt3_3
When lava at the surface of magma\nhardens, and the magma inside flows\lout, caverns are left behind.

#org @gText_mtember_ariana_1
Hmm, so [GREEN]Moltres[RED] used to be\nfound here[.]\pNow, it's found back in its\noriginal location at Victory Road.

#org @gText_mtember_ariana_22
Now it's been replaced with[.]

#org @gText_mtember_ariana_2
[RED][.] oh? Well, I did say I'd hope to\nsee you as Champion if we met again!\pWhat a pleasant surprise.\pWell, there's no way I'd pass up\na battle against you.\pSorry, you're on!

#org @gText_MtEmber_arianaLoss
Hah, if only I had Archer to\nback me up like last time.

#org @gText_mtember_ariana_3
[GREEN]Archer [RED]and I have been checking\nout the Seviis since our last scuffle.\pThere's quite a few interesting things\nhere, like Pok\emon having the potential\lto evolve into their Hisuian forms\lhere.\pNot only that, there are some\nexclusive Seviian forms found here too.\pHere, follow me so [GREEN]Archer[RED] could\ntell you some more.

#org @gText_mtember_archer1
[GREEN]Archer: [BLUE]Hmm, so Heatran's here\ninstead eh[.]

#org @gText_mtember_archer2
[GREEN]Ariana: [RED]Hey [GREEN]Archer, [PLAYER][RED]\nhappened to be here.

#org @gText_mtember_archer3
[GREEN]Archer:[BLUE] Oh hey!\nGood to see you, [GREEN][PLAYER]!\p[BLUE]Have you given him the run-down\nof the Sevii Islands?

#org @gText_mtember_archer4
[GREEN]Ariana: [RED]I've told him a bit,\nyou can tell him of your findings\lthough.

#org @gText_mtember_archer5
[BLUE]Well, I'll give you the full rundown\nshortly. Let's put this [GREEN]Heatran[BLUE]\lto the test!

#org @gText_MtEmber_MaxieLoss
Some things never change.

#org @gText_mtember_archer6
[BLUE]I'm mostly here to investigate\nthe different Legendaries that\lhave appeared here in the Seviis.\pSupposedly, legendaries from other\nregions have made their home in some\lexisting areas even in Kanto.\pHow they've come here, I'm not\nsure.

#org @gText_mtember_archer7
[BLUE]But, I do know the boss ran into\nhis kid here.\pI think last I heard they\ntravelled to Navel Rock to see\lif Ho-Oh and Lugia are still present\lthere.

#org @gText_mtember_archer8
[BLUE]Well, let us know if your findings\nif we see each other again.\pHere, have this.

#org @gText_mtember_archer9
You received an [GREEN]Aerodactyl!

#org @gText_mtember_archer10
[BLUE]This is a special [GREEN]Aerodactyl[BLUE]\nwith exclusive moves Brave Bird\land Headlong Rush.\pBrave Bird's a cool combo with Rock\nHead, and a potent STAB for its Mega,\lwhile Headlong Rush also gets boosted\lby Tough Claws.\pUnfortunate I couldn't find one\nwith Head Smash!\pWell, until next time.\pOh, and if you'd like [GREEN]Heatran,[BLUE]\nhe's all yours!

#org @gText_MtEmber_Heatran1
Gwogobo gwobobobo!
